  "abstract": "Fourier forecaster with LayerNorm in factor space and residual copy, enhanced by Spectrum-Adaptive Projection (SAP): learned sigmoid gates over projection columns (Pmax=48) with L1+entropy regularization to adapt effective rank (~p\u224836). Optimizer: Adam lr=9e-4 with global grad clipping (1.0). Loss: MAE + temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4). Exports gate stats in complete().",
